<title>USA: Optical Cable says short interest falls.</title>
<headline>Optical Cable says short interest falls.</headline>
<dateline>ROANOKE, Va. 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optical Cable Corp said Tuesday that short interest in the company started to fall in December from 766,597 shares down to 750,122.</p>
</text>
